      "a": "The balanced chemical equation corresponding to the given expression can be written as:\n$4{\\text{NO (g}}) + 6{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O (g}}) \\rightleftharpoons 4{\\text{N}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{(g}}) + 5{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{(g)}}$"
