      "q": "9. Which of the two: ${{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{NC}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O --}}$ or ${\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O --}}$ is expected to be more stable and why?",
